      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2  每个通道平移到中点\n\nad = Gtail,d / 2\nKFactor：exp(Gi,d − ad)\nKInvFactor：exp(ad − Gi,d)\n\n最大正指数：maxd |Gtail,d| / 2",
